      <h2 class="details-heading reveal reveal-delay-1">Hi there</h2>
      <p class="details-body reveal reveal-delay-2">
        I'm Prabuddha, a final-year ECE student at <a href="https://vit.ac.in" target="_blank">VIT Chennai</a> graduating in 2026. I build AI systems and backend infrastructure — the kind that ships to real users, handles real data, and doesn't break under load.
      </p>
      <p class="details-body reveal reveal-delay-3">
        My work spans two tracks: <strong style="color:var(--text)">Generative AI</strong> (RAG pipelines, Qdrant, FAISS, LlamaIndex, multimodal models) and <strong style="color:var(--text)">backend engineering</strong> (Golang microservices, PostgreSQL, Docker, auth systems). Two patents published. Two internships shipped. Oracle GenAI certified. If you're interested in what I'm building next, feel free to <a href="#contact">reach out</a>.
      </p>

